<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT - Acesita started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Acesita started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Tuesday analysts Marcelo Chan and Alvaro Maia had started coverage of Brazilian steelmaker Acesita SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>    -- In a February 28 report, they set a price target of $3.64 per 1,000 shares, representing a dollar return of 30 percent.</p>
<p>    -- The company's shares were unchanged at 2.81 reais in</p>
<p>Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>    ((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
</text>
